\f1\fs50\fsmilli25363 \cf2 \cb3 Lab 112 \'97 Monitor GPU Cluster with Prometheus\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa383\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs41\fsmilli20741 \cf2 \cb3 Here\'92s a practical, end-to-end lab to monitor a Kubernetes GPU cluster with Prometheus (plus Grafana dashboards and basic alerts). You\'92ll deploy NVIDIA\'92s DCGM Exporter to expose GPU metrics, scrape them with Prometheus, visualize in Grafana, and add alert rules.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa191\partightenfactor0

