\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\fs41\fsmilli20741 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prometheus
\f2  scrapes those metrics + standard cluster metrics (node exporter, kube-state-metrics).
\f3\fs32 \cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\fs41\fsmilli20741 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Grafana
\f2  visualizes everything (dashboards).
